%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e8f4f8', 'primaryTextColor':'#2c3e50', 'primaryBorderColor':'#3498db', 'lineColor':'#3498db', 'secondaryColor':'#f0f9ff', 'tertiaryColor':'#e0f2fe', 'noteBkgColor':'#fff7ed', 'noteTextColor':'#2c3e50', 'noteBorderColor':'#f59e0b', 'activationBkgColor':'#dbeafe', 'activationBorderColor':'#3b82f6'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as FileEditor
    participant CM as CommandManager
    participant Cmd as RestoreVersionCommand
    participant VS as VersionService
    participant FSS as FileSystemService
    participant MinIO as MinIO

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,MinIO: Undo Restore
    end

    User->>UI: Press Ctrl+Z (Undo)
    activate UI

    UI->>CM: undo()
    activate CM

    CM->>CM: Pop from undoStack
    CM->>CM: Check command.canUndo()
    rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
        Note right of CM: CommandManager checks canUndo()<br/>before calling undo()<br/>If false, put back to stack and throw error
    end
    CM->>Cmd: undo()
    activate Cmd

    rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
        Note right of Cmd: Template Method Pattern<br/>BaseCommand.undo() orchestrates:<br/>1. Check if executed == false (throw error)<br/>2. Check canUndo() again (throw error if false)<br/>3. Call doUndo() hook<br/>4. Set executed = false (after doUndo returns)
    end

    Cmd->>Cmd: Check if executed == false
    Cmd->>Cmd: Check canUndo() again
    Cmd->>Cmd: doUndo() <<hook method>>
    activate Cmd

    Cmd->>Cmd: Check previousVersionId exists
    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note right of Cmd: Memento Pattern<br/>Restore previous content<br/>from saved memento
    end

    Cmd->>VS: restoreFileVersion(projectId, filePath, previousVersionId)
    activate VS
    VS->>FSS: POST /api/projects/{projectId}/files/restore<br/>{path: filePath, versionId: previousVersionId}
    activate FSS
    FSS->>FSS: restoreFileVersion(projectId, filePath, previousVersionId)
    FSS->>FSS: getFileVersion(projectId, filePath, previousVersionId)
    FSS->>MinIO: getObject(bucket, objectName, {versionId: previousVersionId})
    activate MinIO
    MinIO-->>FSS: Previous version content stream
    deactivate MinIO
    FSS->>FSS: Read stream to string
    FSS->>FSS: Create buffer from content (Buffer.from(content, 'utf8'))
    FSS->>MinIO: putObject(bucket, objectName, buffer, buffer.length,<br/>metadata: x-amz-meta-restored-from, x-amz-meta-restored-at)
    activate MinIO
    rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
        Note right of MinIO: MinIO creates NEW version<br/>with previous content<br/>(Versioning is automatic)
    end
    MinIO->>MinIO: Generate new versionId
    MinIO-->>FSS: Success, new versionId
    deactivate MinIO
    FSS-->>VS: {success: true, message: "File restored to version ...", path: filePath, restoredFrom: previousVersionId}
    deactivate FSS
    VS-->>Cmd: {success: true}
    deactivate VS

    Cmd->>Cmd: onContentUpdate(previousContent)
    Cmd-->>Cmd: doUndo() returns
    deactivate Cmd
    Cmd->>Cmd: this.executed = false
    Cmd-->>CM: Undo complete
    deactivate Cmd

    CM->>CM: Push to redoStack
    CM->>CM: emitStateChange()
    CM-->>UI: Undo successful
    deactivate CM

    UI->>UI: Refresh file content
    UI-->>User: "Restore undone"
    deactivate UI
